      "id": "claim_25dcdeb195844d86b3cba0301b7c8df2",
      "statement": "ChunkReadCache (src/disk/caches.rs) is a 16-shard lock-free cache for individual 64KB chunk decompressions of seekable files; keyed by (inode_id, chunk_idx, raw_entry, valid_len); copy_slice_if_hit serves sub-chunk reads directly under shared read lock; sequential access detection triggers parallel prefetch of up to 4 subsequent chunks via par_for_index.",
